Package: kavita
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.kavitareader.com
Description: Kavita Reading Server - comics, manga, ebooks and magazines
 Kavita is a self-hosted digital library for comics, manga, books and
 magazines. Build libraries from any folder on the NAS (including TOS
 shared folders), browse and read in any browser with a fast reader,
 users and roles, age ratings, reading progress sync, OPDS access and
 extensive metadata management.
 .
 The web UI opens in a new browser tab via the TOS App Center route
 /kavita/. The backend listens on loopback only; no external port is
 exposed. On first visit you create the admin account, then add your
 library folders. Data (database, covers, cache, logs) lives in
 /var/lib/kavita.
